OL,3,GNEWSACouncil investigates Reform UK's
OL,4,A'Farage Fest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of "Farage Fest" - a
OL,7,Fvictory party and rally for the Reform
OL,8,FUK leader after the Clacton by-election
OL,9,F- are being investigated for failing to
OL,10,Fget permission to hold it.
OL,12,FTendring District Council said it had
OL,13,F"refused" to grant a Late Temporary
OL,14,FEvent Notice (LTEN) because the
OL,15,Fapplication had not been made in time,
OL,16,Fbut Reform went ahead.
OL,18,FHundreds went to the overnight party
OL,19,Fattended by Nigel Farage at Great
OL,20,FOakley airfield, which included live
OL,21,Fmusic, alcohol, and a ferris wheel.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
