OL,3,GNEWSACouncil investigates Reform UK's
OL,4,A'Farage Fest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa Hastings, the council's corporate
OL,7,Fdirector for law and governance, said:
OL,8,F"No authorisation was granted under a
OL,9,FLTEN for the event." Reform has been
OL,10,Fcontacted for comment.
